{
  "name": "老旧漫画站（表格布局、大写标签、font、无 class 列表）",
  "type": "legacy",
  "baseUrl": "https://legacy-d.example",
  "input": "https://legacy-d.example/",
  "routes": [
    { "match": "exact:/", "page": "home.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/book/4001/", "page": "reader.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/book/4002/", "page": "reader.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/book/4001", "page": "detail_001.html" },
    { "match": "prefix:/book/4002", "page": "detail_002.html" }
  ],
  "home": {
    "selector": "table.list tr",
    "expectedCount": 18,
    "titleFrom": "text",
    "coverAttr": "src"
  },
  "detail": {
    "titleSelector": "table.info b",
    "chapterSelector": "table.chapter a",
    "pages": [
      { "page": "detail_001.html", "expectedChapterCount": 30 },
      { "page": "detail_002.html", "expectedChapterCount": 24 }
    ]
  },
  "reader": {
    "page": "reader.html",
    "imageSelector": "div#content img",
    "imageAttr": "src",
    "expectedImageCount": 10
  },
  "notes": "2003 年的模板：整页表格排版、大写标签、字体用 font size、列表是「一行一部作品」的 tr，没有任何语义 class。识别器只能靠「父容器下重复同构子元素」推出来。正文容器只有一个 id=content，底部还有三个 80x110 的友链图。"
}
